This product distributes pre-trained model artifacts:

The Docker image redistributes the following model artifacts under their own
licences, which are separate from this product's Apache-2.0 licence and from
the licences of the libraries above.

The seven Hugging Face models are downloaded into /opt/models and pinned to an
immutable commit in app/model_registry.py. The spaCy pipeline is different: it
is a Python package installed into /opt/venv, pinned by release URL and a
SHA-256 hash in pyproject.toml rather than by that registry.

- protectai/deberta-v3-base-prompt-injection-v2 — Apache License 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/protectai/deberta-v3-base-prompt-injection-v2
- unitary/unbiased-toxic-roberta — Apache License 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/unitary/unbiased-toxic-roberta
